#~ "vigtigste handelsknudepunkter er Antwerpen en by, der altid har fulgt "
#~ "sine egne veje – med flair, kreativitet og selvsikkerhed."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Welcome to <strong>Brussels</strong>, the capital not only of Belgium, "
#~ "but of Europe itself. A city where history, politics, art, and chocolate "
#~ "all collide in a vibrant, multicultural atmosphere. With its iconic "
#~ "landmarks, whimsical architecture, grand squares, and quirky corners, "
#~ "Brussels is full of surprises — and there’s no better way to experience "
#~ "it all than from the comfort of a guided bus tour."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Velkommen til <strong>Bruxelles</strong>, ikke blot Belgien, men Europas "
#~ "hovedstad. Her mødes historie, politik, kunst og chokolade i en livlig, "
